<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-08T14:24:39.936Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 14:24:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard is containing a 25‑liter used-oil spill off Mariveles, Bataan, removing 800 kg of oil-contaminated debris while the DENR orders assessment and containment. China has deployed more than 100 warships and coast guard vessels across the western Pacific and sent a survey vessel with unidentified equipment into Scarborough Shoal, raising maritime tension. The U.S. Maritime Security Initiative is providing lasting capability assistance to Southeast Asian partners, including the Philippines. The Philippines is preparing security for the 49th ASEAN Summit in Manila from 16 to 18 November and the PCG delivered 7,000 DSWD food packs to disaster-affected residents in Batanes. 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTFBzblpYb201a05pM0tWaDBaWm00amk4LUhuanlYRWk1Qmp3TDNLRWg2Ql9lMWR0OW5PSEt2TUlZWmxNcmtMX3VUTHRBN1Jyd3R1SVFvYjFTRjl3WWRhQUFWbGhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Malay Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;CGTN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPUGwzMFhEc2Y4UHJPSjI3RDdnWmdZLTNDTFpObF82WHpNV0kteTd5LVdlZ3RzdzEzZVlQWWZPN1d2eDVFc0plSjNxa1ZnSWJRYnEtQnFHV3JPUW1PTjgyZjBBdGZ2R09ONHBKa2JTbmlkR1pRVUNWWFdTb1VIXzFwTG45ZTdsQjhHVDlJUzFCdUZoOU1pY0I4ZFBIajBOeHVqN2VoRVEwMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;thechronicle.com.ph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNMktCUzlUYWtIZm9zOUVBeHQ5a3NDRGNJZHNxZk9oWGpEUVVwNlVlQmxHeFdFcDZ4dnAxMjQ2RmdhM1pDYzZGbnJxNGptMlNtSUZ4R1VWT3NhbG9vWnBfRnFSMHVmNzFCLTlMU211N0QwTkhPcWRUaU52c2ZpMUgwTkhB